  "releaseNotes": "- Automatically collects unreferenced Built-in custom template images after a verified replacement is ready, using the existing durable maintenance queue\n- Preserves current images, official bases and running or stopped sandbox references; retries failed cleanup after service recovery or restart\n- Isolates new custom image identities by installation and serializes template preparation with collection to prevent cross-installation or reactivation races\n- Verifies exact native image deletion, rejects unsafe filesystem references, and safely defers collection on older Runtime services\n- Restores a recovered ready image and cancels its retirement atomically, without adding administrator maintenance settings\n- Updates the Built-in Runtime host service to `1.0.0-beta.35`, reuses unchanged Cube Runtime `1.0.0-beta.34` and existing templates, and preserves configuration, conversations, attachments and Skills",
